{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"34":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)"},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158,"name_native":"كتاب اللباس"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4147,"arabicnumber":4147,"text":"حدثنا ابو توبة، حدثنا سليمان، - يعني ابن حيان - عن هشام، عن ابيه، عن عايشة، - رضى الله عنها - قالت كانت ضجعة رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم من ادم حشوها ليف","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (2082)"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":128}}]}